We need to login to Docker Hub (https://hub.docker.com).

In the jump server, create a SonarQube container using the below command:
docker run -d --name sonar -p 9000:9000 sonarqube:lts-community

After the container has been created, we can verify the SonarQube image pulled from DockerHub and the status of the newly created SonarQube container using:
docker images
docker ps
